        },
        {
          "text": "Mubuzuba obo tamukooyoofwa insoni nkaambo kancito zyanu nzimwandibisizya, nkaambo njoogwisya akati kanu abo bakondwa kulisumpula, Tokooyoolisumpula limbi mucilundu cangu cisalala, ",
