                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "boonse basyeede mucisi ca-Israyeli, Tabakooyoobisya nikuba kwaamba cakubeja, alulimi lwakweena talukooyoojanwa mukanwa lyabo, Nkaambo bayoolala mumacelelo aamweemvwe, alimwi taakwe uuyoobayoosya.",
          "type": "text",
