        {
          "text": "Jehova walobya imbeta izyakamupa mulandu, watandanya basinkondonyoko. Mwami wa-Israyeli, ngu-Jehova, mpali akati kanu, tamukooyooyoowa bubi limbi pe. ",
          "type": "text",
